    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Batch side (Yuca)", "items": [
      "Every heavy step is a Slurm job; nothing heavy runs on the login node",
      "Each job writes a fresh runs/<jobid>/ and later jobs are pointed at earlier run dirs",
      "match.py and export.py run back to back in one job and write analogs_universe.json into the same run dir"
    ] },
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Static side (browser)", "items": [
      "The app has no backend: it fetches one JSON file relative to Vite base ./",
      "MSI is recomputed client-side when the reader changes presets, weights or the logistics λ",
      "Publishing is a deliberate manual copy, so a job never edits the git working tree"
    ] },
